{"_id":"never-stop-blowing-up-rules","name":"Never Stop Blowing Up - Rules","type":"base","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{},"pages":[{"_id":"rules-overview","name":"Game Rules","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h1>Never Stop Blowing Up - Digital Rulebook</h1><p>Welcome to Never Stop Blowing Up, the explosive tabletop RPG where action never stops and the stakes keep getting higher!</p><h2>Quick Access</h2><p><strong>Digital Rulebook PDF:</strong> <a href=\"assets/Never_Stop_Blowing_Up_Rules.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">📖 Open Full Rules PDF</a></p><p><em>Right-click the link above and select \"Open in New Tab\" or \"Save Link As\" to download the complete rulebook.</em></p><h2>Core Mechanics</h2><ul><li><strong>Die Progression:</strong> d4 → d6 → d8 → d10 → d12 → d20</li><li><strong>Exploding Dice:</strong> When you roll the maximum value on a die, roll it again and add the result</li><li><strong>Turbo Tokens:</strong> Spend to add extra dice, boost effects, or influence the story</li><li><strong>Group Abilities:</strong> Special powers unlocked as your group's dice advance</li></ul><h2>Character Stats</h2><h3>The Six Stats</h3><ul><li><strong>🔫 Weapons:</strong> Firearms, melee weapons, ranged combat</li><li><strong>👊 Brawl:</strong> Hand-to-hand combat, physical confrontation</li><li><strong>😎 Hot:</strong> Social interaction, charm, persuasion, charisma</li><li><strong>🚗 Drive:</strong> Vehicle operation, chases, piloting</li><li><strong>💪 Tough:</strong> Endurance, resistance, survival, willpower</li><li><strong>🥷 Sneak:</strong> Stealth, infiltration, subterfuge</li></ul><h2>Turbo Tokens</h2><p><strong>How to Spend Turbo Tokens:</strong></p><ul><li>Add an extra die to any roll</li><li>Activate special player abilities</li><li>Boost damage or effects</li><li>Influence the narrative in dramatic ways</li><li>Power group abilities</li></ul><p><strong>How to Gain Turbo Tokens:</strong></p><ul><li>Rolling maximum value on any die</li><li>Achieving dramatic story moments</li><li>Group accomplishments and teamwork</li><li>GM awards for exceptional roleplay</li></ul><h2>Group Suites</h2><p>Your group chooses a suite that defines your team's specialty and unlocks unique group abilities:</p><ul><li><strong>🕵️ Criminal Conspiracy (d6):</strong> Heists, cons, and criminal operations</li><li><strong>👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 La Familia (d6):</strong> Family bonds and mutual support</li><li><strong>🏍️ Diesel Circus (d8):</strong> Vehicle-based mayhem and stunts</li><li><strong>🎖️ Tactical Command (d8):</strong> Military precision and coordination</li><li><strong>🎯 Alpha Squad (d10):</strong> Elite team operations</li><li><strong>💀 Marauders (d10):</strong> Destructive force and chaos</li><li><strong>🎩 The Continentals (d12):</strong> Sophisticated espionage</li><li><strong>🏆 The Ones (d12):</strong> Peak performance and excellence</li><li><strong>👻 Bustin' Makes Me Feel Good (d20):</strong> Supernatural encounters</li></ul><h2>Quick Play Tips</h2><ol><li><strong>Start Small:</strong> Begin with d4 or d6 dice and work your way up</li><li><strong>Embrace Explosions:</strong> When dice explode, lean into the chaos and escalation</li><li><strong>Use Turbo Tokens Wisely:</strong> Save them for crucial moments or dramatic reveals</li><li><strong>Work as a Team:</strong> Group abilities are powerful when coordinated</li><li><strong>Keep it Moving:</strong> The game thrives on momentum and escalating action</li></ol><p><strong>For complete rules, character creation, and advanced mechanics, see the full PDF rulebook linked above.</strong></p>"},"image":{},"video":{},"src":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"quick-reference","name":"Quick Reference","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h1>Quick Reference Guide</h1><h2>🎲 Dice Rolling</h2><ul><li><strong>Basic Roll:</strong> Roll your stat die + any applicable modifiers</li><li><strong>Exploding Dice:</strong> Max result = roll again and add</li><li><strong>Success:</strong> Meet or exceed the Difficulty Class (DC)</li><li><strong>Failure:</strong> Take consequences, gain narrative control</li></ul><h2>🎯 Difficulty Classes</h2><ul><li><strong>Easy:</strong> DC 5-8</li><li><strong>Moderate:</strong> DC 9-12</li><li><strong>Hard:</strong> DC 13-16</li><li><strong>Very Hard:</strong> DC 17-20</li><li><strong>Nearly Impossible:</strong> DC 21+</li></ul><h2>⚡ Turbo Token Uses</h2><ul><li><strong>Extra Die:</strong> Add +1d6 to any roll</li><li><strong>Boost Damage:</strong> +3 damage to attacks</li><li><strong>Narrative Control:</strong> Add details to the scene</li><li><strong>Special Abilities:</strong> Activate player/group abilities</li><li><strong>Avoid Consequences:</strong> Reduce injury or setback</li></ul><h2>🏥 Injuries</h2><ul><li><strong>1 Injury:</strong> -1 to all rolls</li><li><strong>2 Injuries:</strong> -2 to all rolls</li><li><strong>3 Injuries:</strong> Incapacitated, out of action</li></ul><h2>🎭 Player Abilities</h2><p>Browse the <strong>Player Abilities</strong> compendium for 36 different abilities organized by category:</p><ul><li><strong>Combat:</strong> Weapon and fighting abilities</li><li><strong>Defense:</strong> Protection and resilience</li><li><strong>Physical:</strong> Athletic and strength abilities</li><li><strong>Stealth:</strong> Sneaking and infiltration</li><li><strong>Social:</strong> Interaction and persuasion</li><li><strong>Mental:</strong> Intelligence and perception</li><li><strong>Technology:</strong> Tech skills and hacking</li><li><strong>Vehicle:</strong> Driving and piloting</li><li><strong>Token:</strong> Turbo token generation</li><li><strong>Utility:</strong> General useful abilities</li><li><strong>Special:</strong> Unique narrative powers</li></ul><h2>🤝 Group Abilities</h2><p>Browse the <strong>Group Abilities</strong> compendium for team powers organized by die requirement and group suite. Each group ability shows its die requirement and frequency of use.</p><h2>📖 Compendiums Available</h2><ul><li><strong>Player Abilities:</strong> Individual character abilities</li><li><strong>Group Abilities:</strong> Team-based powers</li><li><strong>Rules Reference:</strong> This journal with quick rules</li></ul>"},"image":{},"video":{},"src":null,"sort":100,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"never-stop-blowing-up","systemVersion":"1.0.0","coreVersion":"12.343","createdTime":1757447867325,"modifiedTime":1757447867325,"lastModifiedBy":"foundryUser"}}
